---
// How It Works — a real 3-step sequence, so the numbers carry information
---

<section class="how-it-works section" id="how-it-works">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">How it works</span>
      <h2>Three steps to a streak you can't quietly quit</h2>
      <p>Simple setup. Real accountability. Results that last.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="steps-grid">
      <div class="step reveal">
        <span class="step-number">01</span>
        <h3>Create a micro-commitment</h3>
        <p>Pick something so small you can't say no. 10 pushups. 5 minutes of reading. One glass of water. Time-box it: 7, 14, 21, or 30 days.</p>
        <div class="step-example">
          <span class="stamp">10 PUSHUPS · BEFORE 9AM · 21 DAYS</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step reveal">
        <span class="step-number">02</span>
        <h3>Add accountability</h3>
        <p>Invite a partner or create a group. Turn on "All Accountable" so everyone's streak depends on everyone checking in.</p>
        <div class="step-avatars" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="step-avatar av-coral">Y</span>
          <span class="step-avatar av-green">M</span>
          <span class="step-avatar av-purple">S</span>
          <span class="step-avatar-text">Your accountability team</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="step reveal">
        <span class="step-number">03</span>
        <h3>Check in daily</h3>
        <p>Tap to log your completion — optional photo proof with a watermark. Your partner gets notified the moment you're done.</p>
        <div class="step-checkin" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="checkin-btn">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3">
              <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
            </svg>
            Done
          </span>
          <span class="checkin-time">Takes 5 seconds</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="works-highlight reveal">
      <div class="highlight-card">
        <h4>Time-boxed commitments</h4>
        <p>7, 14, 21, or 30 days. Finite feels achievable. Renew if you want to continue.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="highlight-card">
        <h4>Smart nudges</h4>
        <p>Reminded when your partner completes, at the time of day you choose.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="highlight-card">
        <h4>Streak protection</h4>
        <p>Pause a shared streak with your partner for illness or travel. Paused days never count as misses.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .steps-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-8);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-16);
  }

  .step {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: var(--space-8);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .step-number {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--coral-text);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
  }

  .step-number::after {
    content: '';
    display: block;
    width: 32px;
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--coral);
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
  }

  .step h3 {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .step p {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    line-height: var(--leading-normal);
    flex: 1;
  }

  .step-example {
    margin-top: var(--space-5);
  }

  .step-avatars {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: var(--space-5);
  }

  .step-avatar {
    width: 30px;
    height: 30px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #fff;
    border: 2px solid var(--card);
    margin-right: -7px;
  }

  .av-coral { background: var(--coral); }
  .av-green { background: var(--green); }
  .av-purple { background: var(--purple); }

  .step-avatar-text {
    margin-left: var(--space-4);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }

  .step-checkin {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    margin-top: var(--space-5);
  }

  .checkin-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    background: var(--green);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-4);
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
  }

  .checkin-time {
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }

  .works-highlight {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-6);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding-top: var(--space-10);
  }

  .highlight-card h4 {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .highlight-card p {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .steps-grid,
    .works-highlight {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
